---
title: "State Diagram - Subscription"
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    background: '#ffffff'
    noteBkgColor: '#ffffff'
    noteBorderColor: '#999999'
    noteTextColor: '#000000'
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
  state "CANCELLED" as CANCELLED
  state "EXPIRED" as EXPIRED

  [*] --> ACTIVE : Register (FREE plan) / plan order paid [first-month credit granted]
  ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : Buy a different plan (new subscription starts now)
  ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : Period ended (paid plan expires, FREE renews as a new FREE subscription)
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]

  note right of ACTIVE
    Stays ACTIVE when:
    - Monthly cron inside period: expire old credit, grant new
    - Buy the same paid plan again: periodEnd extended
  end note
